Telecom Customer Analytics Dashboard

Project Overview

This Power BI project provides a complete telecom business analysis through interactive dashboards focused on customer behavior, churn analysis, and revenue performance. The dashboard helps businesses track KPIs, identify customer trends, reduce churn, and improve revenue strategies.

Dashboard Modules
1. Customer Analysis Dashboard
This dashboard provides an overview of telecom customers including demographics, customer growth, plan types, and customer distribution.
Key Insights
- Total Customers: 9500
- Active Customers: 7875
- New Customers in 2025: 3143
- ARPU: ₹452.73
- Highest customers belong to the 46–60 age group
- Prepaid plans have the highest customer count

2. Churn Analysis Dashboard
This dashboard focuses on customer churn trends and identifies key reasons behind customer loss.
Key Insights
- Churned Customers: 1625
- Churn Rate: 17.11%
- Highest churn observed in New Delhi
- Major churn reasons:
  - Plan Issues
  - Switched Brand
  - Better Network
  - Poor Service
  - High Cost

Churn Analysis Includes
- Churn by City
- Churn by Gender
- Churn by Plan Type
- Churn by Tenure
- Monthly Churn Trend

3. Revenue Analysis Dashboard
This dashboard tracks telecom revenue performance and business growth trends.
Key Insights
- Total Revenue: ₹43,00,950
- Revenue Growth: 193.66%
- Total Transactions: 9500
- Prepaid plans generated highest revenue

Revenue Analysis Includes
- Revenue Trend Over Time
- Revenue by City
- Revenue by Plan Type
- Payment Method Analysis
- ARPU Tracking

Tools Used
- Power BI
- Excel

 Features
- Interactive Dashboards
- Dynamic Filters
- KPI Cards
- Customer Segmentation
- Churn Monitoring
- Revenue Tracking
- Business Insights

Business Benefits
- Helps identify customer churn patterns
- Improves decision-making using data insights
- Tracks revenue growth and customer trends
- Supports telecom business strategy planning

